#* {{quote-book|en|year=1948|author=Alec H. Chisholm|title=Bird Wonders of Australia|page=13|passage=It was applied methodically, carefully, '''resolutely''', as in the fashion of a Satin-bird with charcoal, desiccated wood or blue from laundry-bags.}}
